{"kind":"html","caption":"采用自底向上的归并排序：先把链表视为长度为 1 的有序段，再依次合并为长度 2、4 的有序段。每轮只修改节点的 next 指针，不创建与链表长度相关的辅助数组，因此时间复杂度为 O(n log n)，额外空间为 O(1)。动画使用示例 [4,2,1,3] 展示分段、归并和重新连接的过程。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>排序链表可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\nh2{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 6px;font-weight:600}\n.sub{color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;margin:0}\n.chain{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px;min-height:52px}\n.node{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;text-align:center}\n.node .value{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.node .meta{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;display:block;margin-top:2px}\n.node.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.node.done{border-color:#3794ff;background:#243b4d}\n.node-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}\n.arrow{font-size:12px;color:#8d8d8d;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.groups{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}\n.group{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30;font-size:11px}\n.group.highlight{border-color:#3794ff}\n.group-title{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.mini-chain{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;align-items:center}\n.mini-node{padding:2px 6px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px}\n.mini-node.pick{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.rule-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px}\n.rule strong{color:#3794ff;display:block;margin-bottom:2px}\n.empty{color:#8d8d8d;font-style:italic;font-size:12px}\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>自底向上归并排序</h1>\n<p class=\"sub\">示例 <span class=\"mono\">head = [4,2,1,3]</span></p>\n<div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div>\n<div id=\"mainChain\" class=\"chain\"></div>\n<div id=\"progress\" class=\"progress\"></div>\n<section class=\"panel\"><h2>本步分段与合并</h2><div id=\"groups\" class=\"groups\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"panel\"><h2>复杂度</h2><div class=\"rule-grid\"><div class=\"rule\"><strong>步长 1→2→4</strong>共 log n 轮，每轮 O(n)</div><div class=\"rule\"><strong>原地重连</strong>额外空间 O(1)</div></div></section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst steps=[{title:'初始链表：每个节点暂时看作一个有序段',nodes:[4,2,1,3],active:[],done:[],groups:[['步长 1：准备两两合并',[4],[2]],['尚未处理',[1],[3]]]},{title:'比较 4 和 2：先接较小的 2，再接 4',nodes:[2,4,1,3],active:[0,1],done:[],groups:[['合并第一对',[4],[2],'=>',[2,4]],['剩余节点',[1,3]]]},{title:'比较 1 和 3：保持 1 → 3',nodes:[2,4,1,3],active:[2,3],done:[0,1],groups:[['已得到有序段',[2,4]],['合并第二对',[1],[3],'=>',[1,3]]]},{title:'步长扩大为 2：合并 [2,4] 与 [1,3]',nodes:[1,2,4,3],active:[0,1],done:[],groups:[['左段',[2,4]],['右段',[1,3]],['已依次选择',[1,2]]]},{title:'继续比较：3 小于 4，接入 3',nodes:[1,2,3,4],active:[2],done:[0,1],groups:[['待比较',[4],[3]],['当前结果',[1,2,3]]]},{title:'右段耗尽，接上剩余的 4；排序完成',nodes:[1,2,3,4],active:[],done:[0,1,2,3],groups:[['最终有序链表',[1,2,3,4]],['返回值',['head → 1']]]}];let index=0;const status=document.getElementById('status'),chain=document.getElementById('mainChain'),groups=document.getElementById('groups'),progress=document.getElementById('progress');function nodeHTML(v,i,s){const cls=s.active.includes(i)?' active':s.done.includes(i)?' done':'';return '<div class=\"node-wrap\"><div class=\"node'+cls+'\"><div class=\"value\">'+v+'</div><span class=\"meta\">节点 '+i+'</span></div>'+(i<s.nodes.length-1?'<span class=\"arrow\">→</span>':'<span class=\"arrow\">→ null</span>')+'</div>'}function valueList(values,highlight){return '<div class=\"mini-chain\">'+values.map((v,i)=>'<span class=\"mini-node '+(highlight&&i===values.length-1?'pick':'')+'\">'+v+'</span>'+(i<values.length-1?'<span class=\"mini-arrow\">→</span>':'')).join('')+'</div>'}function render(){const s=steps[index];status.textContent='第 '+(index+1)+' / '+steps.length+' 步：'+s.title;chain.innerHTML=s.nodes.length?s.nodes.map((v,i)=>nodeHTML(v,i,s)).join(''):'<div class=\"empty\">空链表，直接返回 null</div>';groups.innerHTML=s.groups.map((g,gi)=>{let body='';for(let j=1;j<g.length;j++){body+=g[j]=='=>'?'<div style=\"margin:8px 0;color:#3794ff\">重新连接为</div>':valueList(g[j],gi===s.groups.length-1)}return '<div class=\"group '+(gi===0?'highlight':'')+'\"><div class=\"group-title\">'+g[0]+'</div>'+body+'</div>'}).join('');progress.innerHTML=steps.map((_,i)=>'<span class=\"dot '+(i===index?'on':'')+'\"></span>').join('')}render();setInterval(()=>{index=(index+1)%steps.length;render()},2200);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
